      "created_at": "2015-01-11T23:42:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I love Prime Wardens Tempest. &nbsp;My biggest issue with Tempest has always been his lack of speed to get setup. &nbsp;There's nothing in his deck that lets him search and nothing that gets cards into play or allows him multiple plays in one turn. &nbsp;And he's always the hero where I have 5 cards I'd like out \"right now\" but can't. &nbsp;Sacrificing some damage for a quick rig is incredibly powerful.</p>",
